    id: "varenicline-smoking-cessation", section: "517", title: "Varenicline for Smoking Cessation (Strong Pharmacotherapy)", subtitle: "Bolsters clusters: Tobacco / Smoking, COPD, Cardiovascular longevity, Healthy Lifespan",
