    id: "diabetes-screening-and-prevention", section: "526", title: "Diabetes Screening + Lifestyle Prevention (Honest Split)", subtitle: "Bolsters clusters: Glucose Regulation, Aerobic Exercise, Reducing Ultra-Processed Food",
