    callout: "The jealousy→violence link is confounded and likely bidirectional — jealousy can precede violence, be a tactic within it, or be a reaction to genuine relationship threat — and most evidence is cross-sectional or qualitative, so causal weight is uncertain. Ordinary mild jealousy is not pathological.",
