    id: "bulimia-nervosa-medical-sequelae", section: "713", title: "Bulimia Nervosa — Medical Sequelae & Elevated Mortality", subtitle: "Degrades: Interoceptive accuracy, Bodily vitality, Emotional regulation, Impulse control, Intrapersonal insight",
