    id: "focused-attention-vs-open-monitoring", section: "804", title: "Focused-Attention vs. Open-Monitoring Styles", subtitle: "Bolsters clusters: Meditation / Mindfulness, Guarding Uninterrupted Focus Blocks, Interoception",
