    id: "engineering-flow-conditions", section: "875", title: "Engineering Flow — Challenge-Skill Balance, Clear Goals, Feedback", subtitle: "Bolsters clusters: Flow States, Deliberate Practice & Skill Acquisition, Guarding Uninterrupted Focus Blocks",
