    id: "negative-mindreading-attributions-conflict", section: "1064", title: "Negative Mind-Reading / Distress-Maintaining Attributions → Conflict & Marital Decline", subtitle: "Degrades: marital satisfaction, conflict repair, benefit-of-the-doubt",
