    degrades: ["physical capacity and mobility", "work productivity and sustained focus", "sleep quality", "mood and emotional stability"],
    description: "Low back pain is the single leading cause of years lived with disability (YLDs) on Earth. GBD 2021 counted ~619 million prevalent cases in 2020 and ~69 million YLDs, projected to reach 843 million cases by 2050. Modifiable risks (occupational ergonomics, smoking, high BMI) explain ~38.8% of its YLDs, and most chronic cases have no identifiable structural cause ('non-specific'). The disability is driven by pain-related interference with movement, work, and sleep rather than by tissue damage per se.",
