    id: "cost-rem-behavior-disorder", section: "1564", title: "Isolated REM Sleep Behavior Disorder — The Prodrome You Act Out", subtitle: "Degrades: Neurological Integrity, Sleep Safety, Autonomic Function, Cognition, Future Motor Control",
