    id: "cost-spasticity", section: "1571", title: "Post-Stroke Spasticity — Tightening Toward Contracture", subtitle: "Degrades: Limb Mobility & Dexterity, Self-Care (Dressing/Hygiene), Pain-Free Function, Independence, Quality of Life",
