    id: "cost-narcolepsy", section: "1572", title: "Narcolepsy — Irrepressible Sleep, Cataplexy & Cardiometabolic Shadow", subtitle: "Degrades: Wakeful Attention, Work & Academic Function, Emotional Stability, Cardiometabolic Health, Social Participation",
