    id: "cost-small-fiber-neuropathy", section: "1575", title: "Small-Fiber Neuropathy — Burning Pain the EMG Can't See", subtitle: "Degrades: Pain-Free Function, Autonomic Regulation, Sleep, Sensory Comfort, Quality of Life",
