    id: "anosmia-olfactory-discrimination-loss", section: "1606", title: "Anosmia / Poor Olfactory Discrimination → Missed Hazards, Malnutrition & Depression", subtitle: "Degrades: hazard detection, eating pleasure, mood, social connection",
