    id: "cognitive-flexibility-deficit-creativity", section: "1608", title: "Cognitive-Flexibility / Set-Shifting Deficit → Rigid, Unoriginal Solutions", subtitle: "Degrades: idea flexibility, category-switching, original problem-solving",
