    id: "wisdom-deficit-ardelt", section: "1902", title: "Wisdom Deficit (Ardelt 3D) → Poorer Late-Life Meaning & Higher Death Anxiety", subtitle: "Degrades: Meta-Cognitive, Existential, Intrapersonal",
