    id: "low-self-disclosure-emotional-guardedness", section: "1908", title: "Low Self-Disclosure (Emotional Guardedness) → Stalled Intimacy", subtitle: "weakness: 'Degrades: Seductive, Interpersonal, Emotional, Intrapersonal'",
