    description: "Algorithmic flashcard systems (Anki, SuperMemo) that schedule each item just before it is likely forgotten, combining retrieval practice with expanding intervals. Distinct from generic 'spaced practice' because it is a specific, self-managing tool. A 2026 systematic review/meta-analysis in medical education found users scored roughly 6-11% higher on standardized exams, with a dose-dependent link between cards reviewed and grades.",
