    degrades: ["Bodily", "Volitional", "Interpersonal", "Community", "Financial"],
    description: "Severe resting hypoxemia (typically PaO2 <55–60 mmHg) from advanced lung disease is both a mortality driver and a tether: the landmark NOTT and MRC trials showed continuous long-term oxygen therapy roughly doubles survival versus none in this group, but life becomes bound to ~15–18 hours/day of oxygen. The dependence constrains mobility, social participation and independence even as it prolongs life and improves neuropsychological function and hospital-free time.",
