    id: "cost-sudden-cardiac-arrest-survivorship", section: "2168", title: "Sudden Cardiac Arrest Survivorship (Anoxic Brain Injury)", subtitle: "Degrades: Meta-Cognitive, Logical, Emotional, Bodily, Intrapersonal",
