    id: "vaginal-moisturizers-lubricants-gsm", section: "2236", title: "Vaginal Moisturizers & Lubricants for Comfort (GSM/Dyspareunia)", subtitle: "practice: 'Bolsters clusters: Seductive, Bodily, Interoceptive'",
