    id: "adjustment-disorder-cost", section: "2247", title: "Adjustment Disorder — The 'Mild' Diagnosis With Real Suicide Risk", subtitle: "Degrades: Emotional, Intrapersonal, Volitional, Financial, Interpersonal",
