    id: "color-vision-deficiency-functional-cost", section: "2368", title: "Congenital Color-Vision Deficiency → Occupational Bars & Everyday Color Errors", subtitle: "weakness: 'Degrades: color-coded task performance, occupational eligibility, safety-signal reading'",
