    id: "cost-chronic-hypersensitivity-pneumonitis", section: "2418", title: "Chronic (Fibrotic) Hypersensitivity Pneumonitis", subtitle: "Degrades: Bodily vitality, Naturalist/occupational function, Existential stability",
