    description: "An immune-mediated interstitial lung disease from repeated inhaled antigen exposure (birds, mold, farming), distinct from IPF and other ILDs. Once fibrosis develops the prognosis is grim: median survival in fibrotic HP is about 7.1 years versus far longer without fibrosis, and pathologic fibrosis raises mortality roughly six-fold (HR ~6.0). Declines of FVC >=10% or DLCO >=15% over a year strongly predict death, and a progressive fibrotic phenotype behaves much like IPF.",
