    id: "cost-hht-chronic-epistaxis", section: "2425", title: "Chronic Recurrent Epistaxis & Hereditary Hemorrhagic Telangiectasia", subtitle: "Degrades: Bodily vitality, Emotional regulation, Community participation, Financial",
