    feeds: ["Rhetorical", "Intrapersonal", "Emotional", "Interpersonal"],
    description: "Having people briefly reflect on an important personal value before a threatening or persuasive message reduces defensive processing and increases openness to the message. Epton et al.'s meta-analysis (Health Psychology 2015; 41 studies) found small but significant positive effects of self-affirmation on message acceptance, intentions, and subsequent behavior.",
