    callout: "Educational, not medical advice. Evidence is small crossover studies (n≈15) measuring acute postprandial glucose, not long-term HbA1c or clinical outcomes. Real-world durability and effect on hard endpoints are unproven; benefit is modest and additive, not a substitute for diet quality.",
