    id: "ntd-cutaneous-leishmaniasis-scarring", section: "3188", title: "Cutaneous Leishmaniasis — Lifelong Scars and Hidden Depression", subtitle: "Degrades: Aesthetic self-image, Interpersonal standing, Intrapersonal wellbeing, Emotional",
