    id: "self-imposed-deadlines-precommitment", section: "3269", title: "Self-Imposed Deadlines (Precommitment against Parkinson's Law)", subtitle: "practice: 'Bolsters clusters: Procrastination Reduction, Self-Imposed Deadlines, Goal Follow-Through'",
