    id: "disable-notifications-dnd", section: "3302", title: "Disabling Notifications / Do-Not-Disturb (Honest — Mixed)", subtitle: "practice: 'Bolsters clusters: sustained attention, reduced ADHD-like symptoms, interruption control'",
