    degrades: ["Interpersonal", "Emotional", "Rhetorical"],
    description: "Criticism reframes a specific behavior complaint into a global indictment of the partner's character ('you always… you never… what's wrong with you'). This 'harsh startup' predicts how the whole conversation goes and often opens the door to contempt and defensiveness. The distinction between a behavior-specific complaint and a character attack is the pivot between a solvable disagreement and an escalating one.",
