    id: "cost-kleine-levin-syndrome", section: "3378", title: "Kleine-Levin Syndrome — Recurrent Hypersomnia That Steals Adolescence", subtitle: "Degrades: Meta-Cognitive function, Interpersonal relationships, Existential continuity, Financial/educational trajectory",
