    id: "cost-delayed-sleep-wake-phase-disorder", section: "3380", title: "Delayed Sleep-Wake Phase Disorder — When the Body Clock Runs Late", subtitle: "Degrades: Interoceptive circadian alignment, Emotional stability, Meta-Cognitive focus, Financial/academic performance",
