    id: "cost-nightmare-disorder", section: "3382", title: "Nightmare Disorder — Recurrent Dream-Fear and Independent Suicide Risk", subtitle: "Degrades: Emotional regulation, Interoceptive sleep quality, Intrapersonal wellbeing, Existential safety",
