    id: "fasting-insulin-homa-ir", section: "3724", title: "Fasting Insulin & HOMA-IR — See Insulin Resistance Early", subtitle: "practice: 'Bolsters clusters: Metabolic Syndrome, Nutrition / Diet Quality, Triglyceride-to-HDL Ratio'",
