    id: "homocysteine-low-value", section: "3728", title: "Homocysteine — Lowering It Doesn't Help (Honest)", subtitle: "practice: 'Bolsters clusters: hsCRP — The Inflammatory Half of Heart Risk, ApoB (or Non-HDL-C) Over LDL-C Alone'",
