    id: "disposition-effect-weakness", section: "3977", title: "Disposition Effect (Selling Winners, Holding Losers)", subtitle: "weakness: 'Degrades: Return-Chasing & the Behavior Gap, Fee-Aware Investing, Automated & Index Investing'",
