    id: "choice-overload-401k", section: "3978", title: "Choice Overload in Retirement Menus", subtitle: "weakness: 'Degrades: Automatic Enrollment & Smart Defaults, Tax-Advantaged Retirement Saving, Naive 1/N Diversification'",
