    description: "A self-relaxation method using repeated autosuggestive phrases ('my arm is heavy and warm') to elicit a parasympathetic relaxation response. Stetter & Kupper's (2002) meta-analysis of 60 controlled studies (35 RCTs) found medium effect sizes for psychological (d ~0.75) and biological (d ~0.68) indices, with medium-range benefits for anxiety and mild-to-moderate depression, tension headache, and hypertension.",
