    id: "pre-exercise-static-stretching-myth", section: "4165", title: "Pre-Exercise Static Stretching (Honest: No Injury Prevention)", subtitle: "practice: 'Bolsters clusters: Bodily range of motion — but NOT injury prevention or performance'",
