    id: "hpv-vaccine-invasive-cervical-cancer", section: "4209", title: "HPV Vaccination Prevents Invasive Cervical Cancer", subtitle: "practice: 'Bolsters clusters: Cervical Cancer Prevention, Cancer Screening, Strategic-about-health'",
