    id: "folic-acid-neural-tube-defects", section: "4210", title: "Periconceptional Folic Acid Prevents Neural-Tube Defects", subtitle: "practice: 'Bolsters clusters: Prenatal Prevention, Birth-Defect Prevention, Strategic-about-health'",
