    description: "A cheap piece of foam with large protective effects in a crash. A systematic review and meta-analysis (40 studies, >64,000 injured cyclists) found helmet use associated with a 51% reduction in head injury, 69% in serious head injury, and 65% in fatal head injury, with no meaningful effect (either way) on neck injury. Classic unglamorous prevention with a big payoff when it matters.",
