    description: "The pop retelling ('everyone caves to the group') inverts Asch's actual data. Across the classic line-judgment trials, participants gave the independent, correct answer on about two-thirds of critical trials (~63–76%); only ~5% conformed every time and ~25% never conformed. A survey of 20 textbooks found 19 omitted this. Useful calibration: normative pressure is real but resistible, and independent dissent is statistically the majority response.",
