    id: "founder-age-experience-advantage", section: "4331", title: "Founder Age & Domain Experience (Young-Founder Myth Busted)", subtitle: "practice: 'Bolsters clusters: Entrepreneurial venturing, Strategic judgment, Financial credibility'",
