    id: "spatial-skills-are-trainable-and-transfer", section: "4383", title: "Spatial Skills Are Trainable & Transfer", subtitle: "practice: 'Bolsters clusters: Spatial, Mathematical, Mechanical, Pattern-Recognition'",
