    id: "confidence-accuracy-memory-wixted", section: "4437", title: "Initial Confidence in Memory IS Diagnostic (Under Clean Conditions)", subtitle: "practice: 'Bolsters clusters: calibrated confidence in memory, Adversarial/legal reasoning, Meta-Cognitive accuracy'",
