    id: "disfluency-improves-reasoning-failed", section: "4443", title: "Hard-to-Read Fonts to Think Harder — A Finding That Didn't Hold", subtitle: "practice: 'Bolsters clusters: analytic override, Logical reasoning (claimed — largely failed to replicate)'",
