    id: "trauma-resilience-is-the-norm", section: "4462", title: "Resilience Is the Ordinary Norm, Not the Exception", subtitle: "practice: 'Bolsters clusters: Existential, Intrapersonal, Emotional, realistic self-concept after adversity'",
